    "note":  "If hr exists, FR metrics (lpips,dists) are computed. NR metrics (niqe,maniqa,musiq,clipiqa) are always computed on res. For FR alignment, hr is transformed to res size with diffusers resize_mode=\u0027crop\u0027 center-crop semantics when fr_resize=to_res_crop (legacy alias: to_ref).\nRestoration metrics are computed on Y channel with crop_border=scale. If shape mismatches, hr is aligned to res using diffusers resize_mode=\u0027crop\u0027 center-crop semantics."
